      "id": 1,
      "title": "Distributed Tracing Pipeline & Observability Links",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### \ud83e\udded Distributed Tracing Pipeline\n\n`election-api` *(HTTP Route)* &rarr; `async-proxy-ingress` *(gRPC Publish)* &rarr; `JetStream` *(Broker Queue)* &rarr; `async-proxy-egress` *(Dispatcher Stream)* &rarr; `election-actors` *(Mailbox & Step Execute)* &rarr; `PostgreSQL` *(Batch Flush)*\n\n**Quick Access Links**: [\ud83d\udd0d Open Jaeger UI (localhost:16686)](http://localhost:16686) | [\ud83d\udcca Business & Scalability Dashboard](/d/election-system-scalability) | [\ud83d\udd0e Grafana Jaeger Explore](/explore?left=%5B%22now-1h%22,%22now%22,%22jaeger%22,%7B%22queryType%22:%22search%22,%22service%22:%22election-actors%22%7D%5D)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "End-to-End Transit Lag (p95)",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(actor_envelope_transit_lag_seconds_bucket[30s]))) * 1000",
          "legendFormat": "p95 Lag",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
